  <TM_GiantSkeletonR.label>巨型骷髅</TM_GiantSkeletonR.label>
  <!--原中文: '巨大的骷髅这种邪恶的东西要么是由一个巨大生物的骨头而诞生的，要么是由较小生物的骨头合成的。这具骷髅以法力为动力，\n  以一种在世界上游荡多年的复仇精神为执念——足够长的时间发展出一种对生命的简单的感情、专一的仇恨。', 原英文: '无' -> 新英文: 'An enormous skeleton; this abomination was either created from the bones of a giant creature or by combining the bones of lesser creatures. This skeleton is animated by necromancy and embodied by a vengeful spirit that has wandered the world for ages - long enough to develop a simple, single-minded hate for life.',更新于2026-02-14-->
  <!--EN: An enormous skeleton; this abomination was either created from the bones of a giant creature or by combining the bones of lesser creatures. This skeleton is animated by necromancy and embodied by a vengeful spirit that has wandered the world for ages - long enough to develop a simple, single-minded hate for life.-->
  <TM_GiantSkeletonR.description>巨大的骷髅这种邪恶的东西要么是由一个巨大生物的骨头而诞生的，要么是由较小生物的骨头合成的。这具骷髅以法力为动力，\n  以一种在世界上游荡多年的复仇精神为执念——足够长的时间发展出一种对生命的简单的感情、专一的仇恨。</TM_GiantSkeletonR.description>
